Hi!
this mail has nothing to do with linux on alpha!
I notice the decrease in the number of mails since
yesterday, because all this situation in the USA i
bealive.
I know most of the people in the list are from the
USA, so i'd like to send my warm regards and a word
of hope to those who are involved in some way in that
tragedy.
I'm from a very small country, and we have lots of diferences
from one city to another. But if something like that happened
in Portugal we would be very concerned with each other,
like people in the USA must be right know.

My apologies for all the others who don't care about this.

Nelson




