I assume that when you ARE there that you get through to a working system.

You need to change the SRM enviroment to pass through the boot flag '1'
ie at the srm console

    set boot_osflags 1

(I'm assuming that the Miata SRM console is similar to mine)
You might wish to take time out to play with SRM.

Some documentation on srm:
ftp://ftp.uk.linux.org/LDP/HOWTO/SRM-HOWTO.html

Phil
=--=




