I had this problem also.  The way I fixed it was to edit
/usr/src/linux-2.4.9/drivers/char/pc_keyb.c.  At line 35 I added the
following:

#include <linux/kd.h>


This should clear up the 'old_rep'/'kbd_repeat' error I believe you are
having.
Ken


