do a:
more /proc/modules

which driver is being used   tulip or de4x5 
I'm using de4x5 on my xp1000 and am having no problems (RH7.1 w/kernel
2.4.3-12)

If it says you are using the tulip you can try the de4x5 by creating a
entry in /etc/modules.conf to alias the tulip.
REMOVE a line that says "insmod tulip" if it exists (or comment it out)
ADD    "alias tulip de4x5"

**without the quotes

JJ

