been a lot of talk lately with the new KDE 2.2.1 about optimizing the
library loader to speed up both KDE start time as well as the
applications (konqueror, koffice, etc)  They now have the RedHat Alpha
rpms for 2.2.1 on the KDE site - give them a try.

